6. Ten days later a responsive CAD record was printed inside its Central Re=
cords Section; it was produced to me on July 14, 2026 =97 in full, with no =
exemption claimed and no fee charged =97 after
 being conditioned for three months on a $12.50 payment and a mailed paper =
form. One hundred and ten days after the request, five of the requested cat=
egories remain without any disposition, no exemption has been cited for any=
thing, the search has never been
 described, the fee waiver has never been ruled on, and the litigation pres=
ervation notice I served on April 2, 2026 has never been acknowledged.</div=
>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_MSFontService,-apple-sys=
